{"ref":"BDB, עֵ֫פֶר","hw":"עֵ֫פֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵ֫פֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Αφερ, etc.;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  ‘son’ of Midian <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:4\" href=\"/Genesis.25.4\">Gn 25:4</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.33\">1 Ch 1:33</a> (𝔊L Γοφερ).<br><strong>2.</strong>  in Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.17\">1 Ch 4:17</a> (A Γαφερ).<br><strong>3.</strong>  in Manasseh <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.24\">5:24</a>.","next":"BDB, עַפְרָה","prev":"BDB, עֹ֫פֶר"}